Z||000003||Taijiguy||05-16-2001||08:22 PM||||I've heard that story before, and as good as it is, I think it's an urban legend. Primarily because a trained retriever won't move until commanded. Holding until given the order is one of the first things a retriever learns. <BR>Now, if it <I>is</I> true, then that was one unfortunate chain of events...||||reg||1
